node.doctext:
So, I confirm the <tt>EXTENDED_TESTING</tt> works with cpancover, but you do need <tt>AUTOMATED_TESTING</tt> for cpantesters, as they don't install "recommends" options, so I went with something like:
<code>
my $extra_test =
  ( $ENV{EXTENDED_TESTING} || $ENV{AUTOMATED_TESTING} )
  ? 'requires'
  : 'recommends';

$WriteMakefileArgs{META_MERGE}->{prereqs}->{test} = {
    $extra_test => {
        'Test2::Plugin::BailOnFail' => '0',
        'Sub::Override'             => '0'
    }
};

</code>
